      "end": 303.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Go.",
      "trans": "英语：Go.",
      "start": 303.4,
      "end": 306.92
    },
    {
      "text": "So you would use this when you agree with somebody, but you're not really happy about it.",
      "trans": "所以，当你同意某人时，你就会使用这个；但你并不真正喜欢它。",
      "start": 306.92,
      "end": 311.0
