      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 322.0,
      "end": 323.0
    },
    {
      "text": "So even though we have the word find in there, it's not really a nice thing to say to someone.",
      "trans": "所以尽管我们有“找到”这个词，这并不是一个好主意。",
