      "end": 333.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 333.24,
      "end": 334.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's listen to our dialogue again, and then we'll talk about some more phrases.",
      "trans": "让我们再次听一下我们的对话，然后我们再聊一些更多的表达方式。",
      "start": 334.24,
      "end": 341.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Hey, daddy.",
      "trans": "你好，爸爸。",
      "start": 341.24,
      "end": 342.8
    },
    {
      "text": "You look great today.",
      "trans": "你看起来今天真好。",
      "start": 342.8,
      "end": 344.48
    },
    {
      "text": "I like your tie.",
      "trans": "我喜欢你的领带。",
      "start": 344.48,
      "end": 346.68
    },
    {
      "text": "By the way, I was wondering, can I?",
      "trans": "英语：顺便说一句，我正想问，能不能？",
      "start": 346.68,
      "end": 349.28000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "No.",
      "trans": "不。",
