    {
      "text": "And in a very polite way.",
      "trans": "英语：And in a very polite way.",
      "start": 409.64,
      "end": 411.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 411.12,
      "end": 412.12
    },
    {
      "text": "So we're going to look at three ways of asking for something.",
      "trans": "所以我们将讨论三种向某人请求的方法。",
      "start": 412.12,
      "end": 416.71999999999997
    },
    {
      "text": "And the first way is I was wondering.",
      "trans": "英语：And the first way is I was wondering.",
      "start": 416.71999999999997,
      "end": 420.4
    },
    {
      "text": "I was wondering.",
      "trans": "我正在想。",
