      "text": "So I could say I was wondering, can I borrow your car?",
      "trans": "所以，我可以借你的车吗？",
      "start": 423.36,
      "end": 426.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 426.88,
      "end": 427.88
