    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 431.36,
      "end": 432.36
    },
    {
      "text": "It's a very nice way to ask something.",
      "trans": "英语：它是一种非常棒的方式来询问这个问题。",
      "start": 432.36,
      "end": 434.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 434.2,
      "end": 435.2
    },
    {
      "text": "It's like to begin a question.",
      "trans": "英语：它像开始一个问题一样。",
      "start": 435.2,
      "end": 436.2
    },
    {
      "text": "To begin.",
      "trans": "开始。",
      "start": 436.2,
      "end": 437.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 437.2,
      "end": 438.2
    },
    {
      "text": "All right.",
      "trans": "好的，以下是“所有好”的翻译：",
      "start": 438.2,
      "end": 439.2
    },
