      "text": "Right.",
      "trans": "正确。以下是“right”在中文中的翻译：",
      "start": 480.84,
      "end": 481.84
    },
    {
      "text": "The I-n-g form.",
      "trans": "这个“I-n-g”形式。",
      "start": 481.84,
      "end": 482.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "trans": "正确答案：完全。",
      "start": 482.84,
      "end": 483.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Giving, holding, finishing.",
      "trans": "给，握，完成。",
      "start": 483.84,
      "end": 486.28
    },
    {
      "text": "So we've got, I was wondering, can I do something?",
      "trans": "所以，我们有，我正想问，我能做些什么？",
      "start": 486.28,
      "end": 489.47999999999996
