      "start": 490.48,
      "end": 492.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 492.92,
      "end": 493.92
    },
    {
      "text": "So you have the I-n-g.",
      "trans": "英语：所以你有这个I-N-G。",
      "start": 493.92,
      "end": 495.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Be very, very careful.",
