      "start": 496.92,
      "end": 500.40000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "trans": "正确。以下是“right”在中文中的翻译：",
      "start": 500.40000000000003,
      "end": 501.40000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "That's wrong.",
      "trans": "这句话的中文翻译是：“那不对。”",
      "start": 501.40000000000003,
      "end": 502.40000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "That's wrong.",
      "trans": "这句话的中文翻译是：“那不对。”",
      "start": 502.40000000000003,
      "end": 503.40000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "So you would say, would you mind giving me?",
