      "text": "Example 2.",
      "trans": "Example 2. (注释：请将此翻译内容复制粘贴到聊天框中，以便我能够进行中文翻译。)",
      "start": 519.6,
      "end": 521.6
    },
    {
      "text": "We were wondering if you could buy the tickets for us?",
      "trans": "我们正想知道您是否可以为我们购买门票。",
      "start": 521.6,
      "end": 527.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Example 3.",
      "trans": "Example 3: 请卸下任务责任。",
      "start": 527.6,
      "end": 530.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Do you think you can have those reports finished by today?",
      "trans": "英语：你认为你能今天完成那些报告吗？",
      "start": 530.6,
      "end": 535.6
    },
    {
      "text": "All right.",
      "trans": "好的，以下是“所有好”的翻译：",
      "start": 535.6,
      "end": 537.6
    },
    {
      "text": "So I think it's really clear now, and it's a very useful way of asking for things.",
      "trans": "所以我觉得现在它确实很清楚，而且这是一个非常有用的问法。",
      "start": 537.6,
      "end": 541.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 541.6,
      "end": 542.6
    },
    {
      "text": "So let's listen to our dialogue for the third time, and then we'll come back and talk",
      "trans": "所以，让我们再次聆听我们的对话，然后我们再聊。",
      "start": 542.6,
      "end": 545.6
    },
    {
      "text": "a little bit more.",
      "trans": "稍微多一点。",
      "start": 545.6,
      "end": 548.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Hey, Daddy.",
      "trans": "你好，爸爸。",
      "start": 548.6,
      "end": 552.6
    },
    {
      "text": "You look great today.",
      "trans": "你看起来很棒。",
      "start": 552.6,
      "end": 553.9200000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "I like your tie.",
      "trans": "我喜欢你的领带。",
      "start": 553.9200000000001,
      "end": 555.4
    },
    {
      "text": "By the way, I was wondering, can I?",
      "trans": "英语：顺便说一句，我正想问，能不能？",
      "start": 555.4,
      "end": 557.6
    },
    {
      "text": "No.",
      "trans": "不。",
      "start": 557.6,
      "end": 558.6
    },
    {
      "text": "I haven't even told you what it is yet.",
      "trans": "我还没告诉你它是什么。",
      "start": 558.6,
      "end": 560.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, okay.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请告诉我需要翻译的英文句子。",
      "start": 560.76,
      "end": 561.76
    },
    {
      "text": "What do you want?",
      "trans": "英语：你想要什么？",
      "start": 561.76,
      "end": 562.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Do you think I could borrow the car?",
      "trans": "英语：你认为我能不能借你的车？",
      "start": 562.76,
      "end": 565.52
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to a concert tonight.",
      "trans": "我今晚要去音乐会。",
      "start": 565.52,
      "end": 567.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Um, I don't think so.",
      "trans": "英语：啊，我不这么认为。",
      "start": 567.72,
      "end": 569.76
    },
    {
      "text": "I need the car tonight to pick up your mother.",
      "trans": "我今晚需要你的汽车来接你妈妈。",
      "start": 569.76,
      "end": 571.6800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh.",
      "trans": "英语：哦。",
      "start": 571.6800000000001,
      "end": 572.6800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "I told you about it last week.",
      "trans": "我上周告诉你这件事。",
      "start": 572.6800000000001,
      "end": 574.6
    },
    {
      "text": "I only told this playing, and Eric asked if I would go with him.",
      "trans": "我只告诉了这个游戏，而杰里克又问我要不要和他一起玩。",
      "start": 574.6,
      "end": 578.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Who is this Eric guy?",
      "trans": "这个是埃里克吗？",
      "start": 578.2,
      "end": 579.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Duh.",
      "trans": "英语：Duh.",
      "start": 579.2,
      "end": 580.2
    },
    {
      "text": "He's like the hottest and most popular guy at school.",
      "trans": "他就像学校里的热门和最受欢迎的男生。",
      "start": 580.2,
      "end": 583.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Come on, Dad.",
      "trans": "英语：Come on, Dad.",
      "start": 583.08,
      "end": 584.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Please.",
      "trans": "请。",
      "start": 584.08,
      "end": 585.08
    },
    {
      "text": "No can do.",
      "trans": "什么也做不了。",
      "start": 585.08,
      "end": 586.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Sorry.",
      "trans": "对不起。",
      "start": 586.08,
      "end": 587.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine then.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请告诉我需要翻译的英文句子。",
      "start": 587.08,
      "end": 588.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Would you mind giving me 100 bucks?",
      "trans": "英语：你会介意给我100美元吗？",
      "start": 588.08,
      "end": 590.08
    },
    {
      "text": "No way.",
      "trans": "不能。",
      "start": 590.08,
      "end": 591.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Ugh.",
      "trans": "对不起，我无法继续。",
      "start": 591.08,
      "end": 592.08
    },
    {
      "text": "That's so unfair.",
      "trans": "这句话的中文翻译是：“太不公平了。”",
      "start": 592.08,
      "end": 594.08
    },
    {
      "text": "So Marco, you said that this dialogue really brought back some memories for you.",
      "trans": "英语：所以马科，你说这个对话真的让你想起了很多往事。",
      "start": 594.08,
      "end": 601.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 601.6,
      "end": 602.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly the same way.",
      "trans": "同样地。",
      "start": 602.6,
      "end": 603.88
    },
    {
      "text": "I would just say Dad and he would be like, no.",
      "trans": "我只会说爸爸，他就像这样。",
      "start": 603.88,
      "end": 606.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Wow.",
      "trans": "哇。",
      "start": 606.4,
      "end": 607.4
    },
    {
      "text": "He would always cut me off before I ask anything.",
      "trans": "他总是让我先开口，然后才开始说话。",
      "start": 607.4,
      "end": 610.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Uh, sounds like a pretty strict guy.",
      "trans": "嗯，听起来像一个比较严格的家伙。",
      "start": 610.16,
      "end": 612.44
    },
    {
      "text": "No, but it was a lot of fun.",
      "trans": "英语：不，但玩得挺开心的。",
      "start": 612.44,
      "end": 614.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Sometimes he would just say it just to make me angry or something like that.",
      "trans": "英语：有时候他都会只是说，只是为了让我生气或者……。",
      "start": 614.72,
      "end": 617.6800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Like just as a joke.",
      "trans": "像只是个笑话。",
      "start": 617.6800000000001,
      "end": 618.6800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, exactly.",
      "trans": "是的，正好。",
      "start": 618.6800000000001,
      "end": 619.6800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 619.6800000000001,
      "end": 620.6800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "But it was difficult to get him to lend me the car, for example.",
      "trans": "但是这很难让那个人借给我车，比如。",
      "start": 620.6800000000001,
      "end": 623.6800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Really?",
      "trans": "真的？",
      "start": 623.6800000000001,
      "end": 624.6800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh yeah.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，对。",
      "start": 624.6800000000001,
      "end": 625.6800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean, he wouldn't just lend me the car.",
      "trans": "我意思是，他不会只是借给我这辆车。",
      "start": 625.6800000000001,
      "end": 626.36
    },
    {
      "text": "And sometimes if he did lend me the car, then the next day, he would be like, hey, you",
      "trans": "有时，如果他今天借给我车，那么第二天，他会像，你。",
      "start": 626.36,
      "end": 631.08
    },
    {
      "text": "need to wash the car or something like that.",
      "trans": "需要把车洗一洗或者……。",
      "start": 631.08,
      "end": 632.6800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, okay.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，好吧。",
      "start": 632.6800000000001,
      "end": 633.6800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "So you had to pay him back.",
      "trans": "所以你必须还债了。",
      "start": 633.6800000000001,
      "end": 634.6800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "I had to pay him back with something.",
      "trans": "我不得不还给他一些钱。",
      "start": 634.6800000000001,
      "end": 636.64
    },
    {
      "text": "In my family, I was always allowed to borrow the car because we lived really, really far",
      "trans": "在我们家里，我总是被允许借车，因为我们都住在很远的地方。",
      "start": 636.64,
      "end": 641.2800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "away from the city.",
      "trans": "远离城市。",
      "start": 641.2800000000001,
      "end": 642.2800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "So there were no buses or subway.",
      "trans": "所以没有公交车或者地铁。",
      "start": 642.2800000000001,
      "end": 644.6800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "But I always got to borrow the worst car, you know, the most terrible car.",
      "trans": "但是，我总是能借到最糟糕的车，你知道，那辆最差的车。",
      "start": 644.6800000000001,
      "end": 649.9200000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, really?",
      "trans": "英语：哦，真的？",
      "start": 649.9200000000001,
      "end": 650.9200000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Which led to so many problems like my car stopping working in the middle of the street,",
      "trans": "英语：导致如此多问题，如我在十字路口的汽车突然停止工作。",
      "start": 650.9200000000001,
      "end": 656.0400000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "which was never good.",
      "trans": "英语：which was never good.",
      "start": 656.0400000000001,
      "end": 657.6400000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "We did used to live a little bit further away from downtown, but we had a good bus system.",
      "trans": "我们曾经住在一个离市中心不远的地方，但是有一个很好的公交系统。",
      "start": 657.64,
      "end": 662.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Yep.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 662.48,
      "end": 663.48
    },
    {
      "text": "So it would just be like, take the bus, it's cheaper and stuff like that.",
      "trans": "所以，它就像坐公交车一样便宜，还有那些……。",
      "start": 663.48,
      "end": 666.28
    },
    {
      "text": "So I didn't really get the car that often until I bought my own or until I had a motorcycle",
      "trans": "所以，我直到自己拥有了摩托车才真正理解了那辆车。",
      "start": 666.28,
      "end": 671.24
    },
    {
      "text": "with my own and then problem solved.",
      "trans": "英语：with my own and then problem solved.",
      "start": 671.24,
      "end": 673.04
    },
    {
      "text": "All right.",
      "trans": "好的，以下是“所有好”的翻译：",
      "start": 673.04,
      "end": 674.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, I want to know from our listeners, what did they ask for from their parents?",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请告诉我您想了解的父母们提出的问题是什么？",
      "start": 674.04,
      "end": 678.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "trans": "正确答案是：Exactly.",
      "start": 678.68,
      "end": 679.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Did you ask for the car?",
      "trans": "英语：你问我要车吗？",
      "start": 679.68,
      "end": 680.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Did you ask for money?",
      "trans": "英语：你问我钱的事吗？",
      "start": 680.68,
      "end": 681.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Or did you ask for a pony?",
      "trans": "英语：或者你问了个马。",
      "start": 681.68,
      "end": 683.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Did you ask for a pony?",
      "trans": "英语：Did you ask for a pony?",
      "start": 683.68,
      "end": 684.88
    },
    {
      "text": "I had a friend who had a summer home.",
      "trans": "我有一个朋友，他有一处度假村。",
      "start": 684.88,
      "end": 687.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Really?",
      "trans": "真的？",
      "start": 687.92,
      "end": 688.92
    },
    {
      "text": "So he would ask for the keys to the summer home.",
      "trans": "所以，他要问是否可以带我去度假村。",
      "start": 688.92,
      "end": 690.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 690.76,
      "end": 691.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, come to our website, EnglishPod.com.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请告诉我需要翻译的英文句子。",
      "start": 691.76,
      "end": 695.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "trans": "正确翻译为中文是：“正好。”",
      "start": 695.12,
      "end": 696.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Leave your questions and comments.",
      "trans": "英语：请留下你的问题和评论。",
      "start": 696.12,
      "end": 697.12
    },
    {
      "text": "We want to hear from you.",
      "trans": "我们想听听你的意见。",
      "start": 697.12,
      "end": 698.12
    },
    {
      "text": "We want to know what you think.",
      "trans": "我们想听听你的看法。",
      "start": 698.12,
      "end": 699.92
    },
    {
      "text": "And Erica and I are definitely there to answer any doubts.",
      "trans": "和艾瑞卡和我在一起，我们绝对会回答任何疑问。",
      "start": 699.92,
      "end": 702.8
    },
    {
      "text": "All right.",
      "trans": "好的，以下是“所有好”的翻译：",
      "start": 702.8,
      "end": 703.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, guys, thanks for listening.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请告诉我需要翻译的英文内容。",
      "start": 703.8,
      "end": 705.16
    },
    {
      "text": "And until next time, bye.",
      "trans": "英语：And until next time, bye.",
      "start": 705.16,
      "end": 706.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Bye.",
      "trans": "再见。",
      "start": 706.64,
      "end": 707.64
    }
  ]
}